 us Notices
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + All September traverse jurors please check the jury status website or
  phone line on Friday\, September 4th after 5pm for further information an
 d reporting instructions.\n  + September 3\, 2026\nRemoved:\n  - Somerset 
 County Superior Court - Skowhegan\n  - All Jurors summonsed for September 
 3\, 2026 please report to the Somerset Superior Court on Thursday\, Septem
 ber 3rd at 8:30 a.m. unless you were previously excused by phone or mail. 
 Thank you.\n  - You can park in the Skowhegan District Court\, Somerset Su
 perior Court\, or the municipal parking lot. PLEASE DO NOT park directly a
 cross from the Somerset Superior Court building. Thank you.\n  - PLEASE CH
 ECK BACK HERE FOR ANY UPDATES TO THE ABOVE or CALL 1-800-872-5539 AFTER 6 
 PM THE NIGHT BEFORE YOU WERE TOLD TO REPORT.\n  - IF THE COURT NEEDS TO CL
 OSE DUE TO INCLEMENT WEATHER A MESSAGE WILL BE PLACED AFTER 7:00 A.M\n  - 
 PROHIBITION OF ELECTRONIC DEVICES: Please be advised that pursuant to Admi
 nistrative Order JB-20-01\, use of electronic devices during trial or whil
 e in deliberations are prohibited and all devices will need to be temporar
 ily surrendered. During jury selection\, all devices must be turned off.\n
   - September 2\, 2026\n  - September Traverse Jurors are to report to the
  York Judicial Center in Biddeford on Wednesday\, September 2nd at the tim
 e listed on your summons for a one-hour orientation.\n  - September 1\, 20
 26\nhttps://www.courts.maine.gov/juror/notice.shtml
