SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Fiscal Year 2027 (FY27) Rate Correction: Sect
 ion 97\, Appendix C\, Residential Care Facilities
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Fiscal Year 2027 (FY27) Rate Correction: Section 97\, A
 ppendix C\, Residential Care Facilities\nFiscal Year 2027 (FY27) Rate Corr
 ection: Section 97\, Appendix C\, Residential Care Facilities\nSep 02\, 20
 26\nMaineCare identified and corrected multiple errors on the FY27 rate 
 letters. Some of these errors resulted in the implementation of new rates
  effective July 1\, 2026. New rates for affected providers were implemen
 ted for billing August 25\, 2026. Updated rate letters are available o
 n the secure online\nHealth PAS portal\n.\nPlease note that all provider
 s will receive updated rate letters regardless of whether rates have chang
 ed or not.\nAdjustment Billing Guidance for Dates of Service July 1\, 2026
  – August 25\, 2026\nProviders are responsible for adjusting claims s
 ubmitted with charges\nbelow\nthe new rates. Per policy\, and to avoid t
 imely filing denials\, adjustments must be submitted within 120 days of
  the most recent claim payment date.\nFor questions\, please contact your
 \nProvider Relations Specialist\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/provide
 rs/provider-bulletins/fiscal-year-2027-fy27-rate-correction-section-97-app
 endix-c-residential-care-facilities
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/fiscal-yea
 r-2027-fy27-rate-correction-section-97-appendix-c-residential-care-facilit
 ies
